{"availability":"available","full":"montimaj/agribound","name":"agribound","description":"An AI-powered field boundary delineation toolkit combining satellite foundation models, embeddings, and global training data for accurate agricultural parcel/field boundary mapping.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":90,"forks":13,"created":"2026-03-26T03:46:35Z","updated":"2026-10-07T22:38:14Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://montimaj.github.io/agribound/","topics":["agriculture","computer-vision","field-boundary","geoai","geospatial","geospatial-foundation-model","pre-trained-model","satellite-embeddings"],"demo":"https://montimaj.github.io/agribound/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.655Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.655Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.655Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.655Z","stars":90,"forks":13}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Agricultural field boundary delineation from satellite imagery","Agribound runs published field-boundary models, geospatial foundation models and embedding-based methods on satellite and aerial imagery through one configuration and one pipeline: composite → optional fine-tuning → delineation → optional SAM refinement → study-area selection → post-processing → LULC crop filter → export. It supports eleven sources (Landsat, Landsat panchromatic, Sentinel-2, HLS, NAIP and SPOT 6/7 composites built on Google Earth Engine; USGS NAIP Plus without Earth Engine; local GeoTIFFs; Google Satellite Embedding and TESSERA embeddings) and seven engines…","Every run is seeded, caches its intermediates under content-addressed names, and writes a provenance record (configuration and hash, package versions, device, step timings, model weights, counts, warnings) next to its output. The package also provides object-level evaluation against reference boundaries, tiling of large regions for HPC clusters, a query helper for the published Fields of The World polygons, and an optional agent layer that proposes one run for a human to approve."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/montimaj/agribound/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6459628cc025e98f73770aba5aa5c071a99b498d2c02ae2c5e607d42fc72af9e","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.826Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.826Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Agricultural field boundary delineation from satellite imagery","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/montimaj/agribound/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6459628cc025e98f73770aba5aa5c071a99b498d2c02ae2c5e607d42fc72af9e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/montimaj/agribound/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.826Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T22:38:14Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/montimaj/agribound/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:23.828Z","hash":"6459628cc025e98f73770aba5aa5c071a99b498d2c02ae2c5e607d42fc72af9e","originalBytes":49358,"storedBytes":49358,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["agribound","sam","ftw","engine","earth","model","delineate-anything","notebook","dinov3","spot","default","google","landsat","run","naip","embedding","polygons","delineate","field","boundary","embeddings","fields","yes","agent","crop","global","satellite","see","against","one","reference","runs","source","world","anything","example","only","prithvi","published","sentinel-2","composite","fine-tuning","geoai","geospatial","local","lulc","new","optional","tessera","boundaries","filter","fine-tuned","models","area","arxiv","configuration","engines","gallery","gee","mcp","plan","python","query","research","tiles","tools","tree","usgs","backend","foundation","hls","hpc","package","refinement","without","crops","data","evaluation","every","land","layer","mexico","project","scripts","sources","study","true","version","wei